			"notes": "Art sources, a world exporter, and the fix for maps going blank after a portal.\n\n**Players:** get the mod from [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/show-my-maps/versions) — one file per game version.\n**Server owners:** `ShowMyMaps-Paper-1.1.1.jar` below goes in `plugins/`. This release carries the server-side half of the blank-maps fix, so it is worth updating.\n**Publishing your maps:** `ShowMyMaps-Export-1.1.1.jar` reads a world folder or a backup zip and writes out every filled map in it, ready to host so clients can fetch the art the server never sends. No plugin, no restart, no open port.\n\n```\njava -jar ShowMyMaps-Export-1.1.1.jar <world folder or backup.zip> <output folder>\n```\n\nFull notes are on each Modrinth version."
		},
